meta {
  name: 10-organization-member
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  The organization endpoints an official client calls for a member: read the
  organization keys, set them, accept an invitation, leave.

  NodeWarden serves these on routes of its own (`/organizations/:id/accept`)
  and answers the official paths with the 501 catch-all, so these requests
  fail until the official routes exist.
}
